# Push to talk in a fake Claude's composer, through its fake /voice: no microphone (the sandbox's is always allowed and
# never opened) and no speech service (the fake Claude hears the transcript it's told). The text lands in the box and
# stays there, unsent.
desc Dictate into a fake session's composer: the mic held (recording), let go, the transcript in the box, not sent.
chat
tell {"op": "voice", "mode": "hold", "transcript": "run the tests on the composer view"}
dictation press
shot recording
dictation release
composer unsent run the tests on the composer view
shot dictated

# What changes from run to run on its own (as in smoke.journey, the same window): the session's age in its sidebar row
# and the header's state pill, the clock time under the question, and the inspector's clock and run values.
mask *-main-* 430 250 75 45
mask *-main-* 1115 118 140 44
mask *-main-* 1940 325 95 35
mask *-main-* 2220 256 340 130
mask *-main-* 2245 770 315 55
mask *-main-* 2440 825 120 75
mask *-main-* 2100 1050 460 550
